  "content": "I recalled being in a dream state while under. I was under anesthesia from 9:30pm Friday to 10am Monday. I recall being on a large promontory in the dark. Way out in front of me was a light, not bright and not dim. I then said, 'Hello.' (No answer). 'Hello, anybody out there?' (No answer). I then asked, 'Can anybody tell me the meaning of life?' Then I received this EXACT ANSWER telepathically, 'Man has not even scratched the surface to know what life is all about.' This answer has changed my life and how I live to this day.",
